# Trims the build context uploaded to Docker/Fly's remote builder. flyctl
# generated an unusable 500-line version of this from every .gitignore in the
# tree; this is the curated replacement. Correctness never depends on it - the
# Dockerfile COPYs named paths only (see components/deploy/Dockerfile).
.git
scratch
docs
components/app
components/assets
components/ios
components/cli/bin
**/node_modules
**/.DS_Store
